Claude Desktop macOS Chinese Companion

Translation data source:
https://github.com/ICERainbow666/claude-desktop-zh-cn

This project thanks the upstream author and community for maintaining the
Simplified Chinese translation files. This repository independently implements
a separate offline macOS companion and never deploys resources to, backs up,
or restores files inside Claude.app. It does not redistribute Claude Desktop
and is not affiliated with Anthropic.
